 CellID->471018832,ExpressionUUID->"c84d306d-f154-4868-9d03-5c2ae3220e1a"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["As a clique complex, g3 has the following cliques:", "ExampleText",
 CellID->347211903,ExpressionUUID->"98a66ef3-80e3-4ee4-9b9b-8239a3375a7f"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell[BoxData[
