 CellLabel->"Out[6]=",
 CellID->561853739,ExpressionUUID->"1bb40c29-9eaa-4b2a-afc3-84b570bf0738"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell["\<\
Put facets1, facets2, and cliques3 into 2 separate lists, facetsList1 and \
cliquesList1:\
