    "ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[xList_List] Given a list xList of \
simplicial complexes (each given as a list of facets), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[xList] returns the largest list of \
non-isomorphic simplicial complexes from xList. \
ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[cmpxList] Given a sequence of lists \
cmpxList of simplicial complexes (each given as a list of facets), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[cmpxList] returns a single list where \
any two complexes originating from different lists are non-isomorphic, but \
two complexes originating from the same list are not checked for isomorphism. \
ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[xList_List] Given a lists of sublists \
xList of simplicial complexes (each given as a list of facets), \
ChooseNonIsomorphicSimplicialComplexes[cmpxList] returns a single list where \
any two complexes originating from different sublists are non-isomorphic, but \
two complexes originating from the same sublist are not checked for \
isomorphism.", "synonyms" -> {}, "tabletags" -> {}, "title" -> 
